From ad4b67cf7cec92bb6b128701d051d88009b7b8fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: batya <batya@github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:58:21 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] feat(ui): workspace sessions, the agent handshake and
 folded song parts

- the control strip learns the session browser, the session/library switch
  and the message log; creating a session is the one modal it opens
- sessions are browsed as a list, the way songs are, so they can grow
- an agent asking to make a track over MCP is answered in a modal: once,
  always for this session, in another session, or not at all
- a song's parts fold under the song in both lists, and both read them from
  one shared module, so a stem looks the same wherever it is shown
